<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ, Postbank raise NZ fixed mortgage rates.</title>
<headline>ANZ, Postbank raise NZ fixed mortgage rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ and Postbank said on Friday they were lifting their fixed mortgage lending rates on Saturday although the one-year rate was left at 9.25 percent.</p>
<p>The two-year rate was lifted to 9.25 percent from 9.15, the three-year to 9.25 percent from 8.95 and and the five year rate to 9.15 percent from 8.95 percent.</p>
